y  gifts of any kind from anybody well as a  final question dr. Carter how would you  summarize your advice to the American  people in 1952 as to what they can do  about this situation well I'd say first  of all educate yourself on public  affairs second be sure to vote and third  be sure your own house is in order and  when the voting time comes be there and  ready to elect somebody who will be  responsible well thank you very much for  being with it to see me the editorial  board for this edition of the  non-synchronous cope was mr. Henry  Hazlitt and mr. william bradford huie  our distinguished guest was dr. charles  francis potter noted philosopher and  author
 

